  ("How is track-out controlled on a construction site?", "With stabilized gravel exits, rumble plates, walk-off mats and regular sweeping."),
  ("Can track-out be washed into the street drain?", "Generally no. Track-out should be swept or vacuumed up, not washed into storm drains."),
